<%- include('partials/header',{title:'Sign in | HealthConnect Bharat'}) %><main class="auth-layout"><div class="auth-aside"><span class="eyebrow">Your care, in view</span><h1>Welcome back<br>to your <em>health space.</em></h1><p>Your next step in care is only a moment away.</p><div class="quote-card">“A little more connected. A little more cared for.”<span>HealthConnect Bharat</span></div></div><section class="auth-card"><a class="back-link" href="/">← Back to home</a><span class="eyebrow">Good to have you here</span><h2>Sign in to your account</h2><p class="muted">Enter the email address connected to your account.</p><% if(error){ %><div class="form-error"><%= error %></div><% } %><form method="post" action="/login" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label>Email address<input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required value="<%= typeof email!=='undefined'?email:'' %>" placeholder="you@example.com"></label><label>Password<span class="password-input-wrap"><input type="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password" required placeholder="Your password"><button class="password-toggle" type="button" data-password-toggle aria-label="Show password" title="Show password"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 12s3.6-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3.6 7-10 7S2 12 2 12Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg></button></span></label><input type="hidden" name="next" value="<%= returnTo %>"><div class="form-between"><span></span><a href="/forgot-password">Forgot password?</a></div><button class="button primary full">Sign in <span>→</span></button></form><div class="auth-switch">New to HealthConnect? <a href="/register">Create an account</a></div><p class="fineprint">Your account is protected with secure sign-in and email verification.</p></section></main><%- include('partials/footer') %>
